flowchart TB
    In([Incident: pipeline failed]) --> P{{Planner: emit JSON plan}}
    P --> E[Execute steps in order]
    E --> Store[(Task state:<br/>plan + results)]
    Store --> I{Enough evidence?}
    I -->|no, re-plan| P
    I -->|yes| S{{Synthesize diagnosis}}
    S --> Out([Root-cause diagnosis])
